# Ctrl+V in Quick Add pastes the text copied last, as it does in the date prompt and edit mode.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
Work:
	- Renew passport
END
keys j j <Enter> <Home> <S-End> <C-c> <Esc> q <C-v>
see Enter adds it
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport
Work:
	- Renew passport
END
